WEBVTT

00:00:04.333 --> 00:00:08.000
WHAT IF TIME DIDN'T EXIST?

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:08.000
TIME STILL PASSES. CLOCKS DON'T.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.567
ALARMS: 0 / DEADLINES: 0 / MONDAYS: 0

00:00:14.533 --> 00:00:17.167
FREEDOM!!!

00:00:17.333 --> 00:00:19.000
WAIT...

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:31.000
DEPARTURE: ??:?? / ARRIVAL: ??? / DELAY: FOREVER?

00:00:27.333 --> 00:00:31.000
FLIGHT DEPARTURE: WHENEVER.

00:00:31.667 --> 00:00:34.333
00:00 → 00:03

00:00:34.333 --> 00:00:35.333
ERROR

00:00:35.333 --> 00:00:39.500
∞

00:00:35.667 --> 00:00:37.500
JUST 10 MORE SECONDS!

00:00:37.533 --> 00:00:39.500
WHAT'S A SECOND?!

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:43.000
EGG TIMER: UNKNOWN

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:47.000
TIME REMAINING: ???

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:46.967
NO SCHEDULES.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:51.333
TIME LEFT: ∞

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:51.300
NO PLAN.

00:00:51.333 --> 00:00:56.000
SCHEDULE ERROR

00:00:52.333 --> 00:00:56.000
BIG PROBLEM.

00:00:57.133 --> 00:01:01.167
SWINGS: 1 … 5

00:01:01.533 --> 00:01:03.833
GENIUS!

00:01:03.867 --> 00:01:08.000
WE INVENTED CLOCKS... AGAIN.

00:01:08.267 --> 00:01:10.133
CLOCKS: ONLINE ✅

00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:16.000
MONDAY 08:00 — WORK STARTS NOW

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:13.567
OH NO.

00:01:13.600 --> 00:01:16.000
MONDAY IS BACK. 💀

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:20.000
3 … 2 … 1

00:01:16.067 --> 00:01:21.000
WOULD YOU DELETE TIME?  YES 😎 / NO 💀

